  "description": "Click here and download the Cute Snowman Christmas 3D STL Model · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Bring cheerful winter charm to your holiday collection with this Cute Snowman Christmas Decor 3D STL. The design features a joyful snowman with a classic black top hat decorated with holly leaves and berries, a cozy red scarf, raised twig-like arms, a carrot nose, and a snowy decorative base.\n\nIts playful expression and festive details make it perfect for Christmas displays, winter décor, seasonal gifting, and 3D-printable holiday collections.\n\nFeatures\nCute smiling snowman character\nClassic Christmas top hat\nDecorative holly leaves and berries\nDetailed red winter scarf\nCarrot-shaped nose\nRaised snowman arms\nThree decorative buttons\nSnow-covered textured base\nStable round display platform\nDetailed 3D sculptural design\nIdeal For\nChristmas home décor\nHoliday tabletop displays\nWinter decorations\nChristmas gifts\nSnowman collections\nMantel decoration\nShelf decoration\nFestive centerpiece\nChristmas craft projects\nSeasonal 3D printing\nPrinting & Technical Recommendations\nFile Format: STL\nCompatibility: FDM and Resin 3D printers\nFilament Suggestion: PLA, Matte PLA, Silk PLA, PETG, or compatible resin\nSupports: Light supports may be required depending on print orientation\nScaling: Easily scalable for different display sizes\nPrint Orientation: Keep the model upright for the intended appearance and stable base\nFinishing: Can be painted or colored after printing for additional festive detail\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself.",
